! khoomei_harmonics_8_16.scl
!
! Khoomei (Mongolian/Tuvan throat singing) works by filtering to single
! harmonics of a sustained drone, so its melody scale is a segment of the
! harmonic series. Harmonics 8 through 16 cover the range typically sung
! above the fundamental: 8:9:10:11:12:13:14:15:16.
!
Khoomei harmonics 8-16
8
